            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Reproduced on current nightly. The issue is that detect_background() calls reset() on the OptionSet before checking if the user already explicitly set 'background'. The fix should check for an explicitly-set value (either from VIMINIT, -c, or a direct :set) before triggering the autodetection. Something like checking the option's scope flags or tracking whether it was set from outside the startup path would do it.",
